=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/ce3adef13a640a8becb11d9af92dbd26.poster.avif?t=1745014775\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/ce3adef13a640a8becb11d9af92dbd26.webm?t=1745014775\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356570/extras/ce3adef13a640a8becb11d9af92dbd26.mp4?t=1745014775\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><i>Checkpoint-Based Saving: The game automatically saves progress at key checkpoints, ensuring a smooth and immersive gameplay experience.</i> </p>",
